description.p:
R3 is hydrogen, NH(C1-C6 alkyl)aryl, NH(C,-C6 alkyl) or NH(C3-C6 cycloalkyl), said aryl group being optionally substituted by 1-3 groups selected from halogen, hydroxy, CF3, NH2, and NO2; 

R4, R, and R6 independently represent a member selected from the group consisting of hydrogen, halogen, hydroxy, CF3, NH2, NO2, Cj-Cζ alkyl, 

 alkoxy, C3-C8 cycloalkyl or aryl;
